  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "4 LLM agents + 1 rule-based service",
      "items": [
        "One LangGraph runtime \u2014 Intake Tracker is rule-based, not LLM",
        "Persona on each box, guardrail on hover. Full detail: agent-specifications.md",
        "Color key matches lfi-pipeline-v1's automation-role legend (teal=LLM-only, peach=LLM+tool, gold=deterministic); security/gold-adjacent here also covers platform infra (LLM Inference, Secrets Manager, Observability, Tracing & Eval) that isn't itself an agent",
        "Approval Coordinator is peach/messagebus, not gold/cloud (fixes Principal Engineer audit 1.5) \u2014 its guarded summarize_feedback() LLM call (ADR-0017) is real tool-calling LLM usage, same as Findings Author and Compliance Analyst"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Platform services (tool-contracts.md) now shown (fixes Principal Engineer audit 1.1/1.2/1.3)",
      "items": [
        "Ingestion Adapter sits between Shared Workspace and Intake Tracker \u2014 the load-bearing boundary ADR-0006 calls out for the eventual Smart Portal swap; SFTP never reaches Intake Tracker directly",
        "Severity Rubric Service, quant_analysis.compute(), and template_fill() are shared, versioned/deterministic services Findings Author calls (and quant_analysis.compute() Compliance Analyst also calls for context) \u2014 not agents themselves, hence gold/cloud, not peach",
        "Notice Corpus Manager is in-app v1 scope (ADR-0029) \u2014 shown peach/messagebus since it uses an LLM/OCR step, but per agent-specifications.md it has no persona or ongoing state; it's a UI-triggered workflow, not a persistent LangGraph agent like the 4 above it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Threat model (ADR-0019)",
      "items": [
        "LLM Inference Service isolated in its own security zone \u2014 only the 4 LLM agents may call it, over mTLS",
        "Secrets Manager holds SFTP/DB/mTLS creds; Fraud DB encrypted at rest"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "HITL checkpoints (ADR-0016)",
      "items": [
        "HITL checkpoints with SLAs \u2014 full current table in agent-specifications.md; count not restated here since it grows as new checkpoints are added (fixes Principal Engineer audit 4.3, which found this card stale after ADR-0029)",
        "Primary trust metric: human-agreement rate. Near-100% = automation-bias risk, not a win"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Observability & evaluation (ADR-0016)",
      "items": [
        "OTel + Prometheus/Grafana for infra; self-hosted Langfuse traces every LLM call and hosts evals",
        "Citation-validity rate gates CI before any prompt/model change ships"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Deployment (ADR-0013/0014/0015)",
      "items": [
        "On-prem for now; LLM self-hosted, Qwen Coder / gpt-oss-120b as swappable candidates",
        "Identity via CBUAE SSO; Fraud DB is Oracle, isolated subnet"
      ]
    }
  ]
